     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi<div><br></div><div>I&#39;ve been using onRender() from htmlwidgets to add plugins to leaflet in shiny as described <a href=\"https://gist.github.com/jcheng5/c084a59717f18e947a17955007dc5f92\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://gist.github.com/jcheng5/c084a59717f18e947a17955007dc5f92&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792390623540000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1zMJn3qfuUUFkBqMt4JnOf\">here</a>.</div><div><br></div><div>This works nicely if the onRender is within renderLeaflet(). However, if I move the onRender() to a leafletProxy() reacting to an actionButton, it doesn&#39;t seem to work. Is there any way around this? Below is an example with a simple onRender() with no additional plugin</div><div><br></div><div>Thanks</div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>This works:</div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">library</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">leaflet</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>library</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">shiny</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>library</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">htmlwidgets</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>runApp</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">list</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">ui</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">pageWithSidebar</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  headerPanel</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Example&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  sidebarPanel</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    actionButton</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;go&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> label</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Go&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  mainPanel</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    leafletOutput</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;map&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>server</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#008\">function</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">input</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> output</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> session</span><span style=\"color:#660\">){</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  output$map </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> renderLeaflet</span><span style=\"color:#660\">({</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>    leaflet</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">quakes</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\">  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      addTiles</span><span style=\"color:#660\">()</span><span style=\"color:#000\">  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      fitBounds</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(~</span><span style=\"color:#000\">min</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#008\">long</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">~</span><span style=\"color:#000\">min</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">lat</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">~</span><span style=\"color:#000\">max</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#008\">long</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">~</span><span style=\"color:#000\">max</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">lat</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      onRender</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;<br>               function(el, x, data) {<br>               for (var i = 0; i &lt; data.long.length; i++) {<br>               L.circleMarker([data.lat[i], data.long[i]]).addTo(this);<br>               }<br>               }<br>               &quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> data </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> quakes</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#066\">100</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,])</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">})</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">}),</span><span style=\"color:#000\">launch</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">browser</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">T</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></div></code></div><div><br></div><div><br></div></div><div>This doesn&#39;t work - markers do not appear when the button is pressed.</div><div><div><br></div><div></div></div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\"><span>library</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span>leaflet</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">)</span><span><br>library</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span>shiny</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">)</span><span><br>library</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">(</span><span>htmlwidgets</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0)\">)</span><br><br><div>runApp(list(ui=pageWithSidebar(</div><div>  headerPanel=(&quot;Example&quot;),</div><div>  sidebarPanel(</div><div>    actionButton(&quot;go&quot;, label=&quot;Go&quot;)</div><div>  ),</div><div>  mainPanel(</div><div>    leafletOutput(&quot;map&quot;))</div><div>),</div><div>server=function(input, output, session){</div><div>  output$map &lt;- renderLeaflet({ </div><div>    leaflet(quakes)  %&gt;%</div><div>      addTiles()  %&gt;%</div><div>      fitBounds(~min(long), ~min(lat), ~max(long), ~max(lat)) </div><div>  })</div><div>  observeEvent(input$go,{</div><div>    leafletProxy(&quot;map&quot;) %&gt;%</div><div>      onRender(&quot;</div><div>           function(el, x, data) {</div><div>               for (var i = 0; i &lt; data.long.length; i++) {</div><div>               L.circleMarker([data.lat[i], data.long[i]]).addTo(this);</div><div>               }}&quot;, data = quakes[1:100,])</div><div>  })</div><div>}), launch.browser=T)</div></span></div></code></div><div><br><br></div></div>"
